      "side": 1,
      "message": "[error] Line 153: 🔴 `setVideoOrientation` can throw through this public API path. `SIPCall::setVideoOrientation` calls `sendSIPInfo`, which throws when the invite dialog is unavailable; here it is called synchronously with no exception handling, so a client request on an early/tearing-down call can terminate the process. Execute on the I/O thread and catch/translate exceptions, returning `false` on failure.",
      "revId": "7a23a0fac714740d071a4b59ce78ca5c2713352d",
      "serverId": "1e26b4c1-6b8c-47ff-9df7-501b633d3b5a"
