      "side": 1,
      "message": "[error] Line 1675: 🔴 The call state is mutated before external SDP validation succeeds. `externalSdp_`, `enableIce_`, and `rtpStreams_` are changed before `setLocalAnswerFromExternalSdp(sdp)`; if parsing/validation fails, the function returns with the call left in external-media mode and streams cleared, which can prevent any later `acceptWithMedia` recovery. Validate first, then apply these state changes only after success (or rollback on failure).",
